      "value": "I thought I'd add that this has been an issue with really small/big avatars for a while due to how nameplates/chatboxes are displayed in the first place. The nameplates are always a set distance from the user's viewpoint rather than it being relative to the avatar's scale. I assume this is just a side effect of that.\n\nFixing this would not only look better, but I'd really appreciate it as someone who uses the chatbox with large (2-2.5m) avatars because my nameplate/chatbox position is too low to my head relative to my avatar.",
